From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nobody <>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 13:40:00 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] fix: restore N_R0_TQ2_0 Metal macros after 0110

Patch 0110 dropped N_R0_TQ2_0 / N_SG_TQ2_0 as "duplicates", but upstream
b11351 needs them for mul_mv TQ2 kernels. Without them Metal library
compile fails on M4 (undeclared identifier N_R0_TQ2_0) and inprocess
segfaults during load.

---
 ggml/src/ggml-metal/ggml-metal-impl.h | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-metal/ggml-metal-impl.h b/ggml/src/ggml-metal/ggml-metal-impl.h
index c033de5a1..38efc73a3 100644
--- a/ggml/src/ggml-metal/ggml-metal-impl.h
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-metal/ggml-metal-impl.h
@@ -96,6 +96,9 @@
 #define N_R0_IQ4_XS 2
 #define N_SG_IQ4_XS 2
 
+#define N_R0_TQ2_0 4
+#define N_SG_TQ2_0 2
+
 // function constants offsets
 #define FC_FLASH_ATTN_EXT_PAD          100
 #define FC_FLASH_ATTN_EXT_BLK          200
